# Claude

## Mục tiêu

Claude là một AI assistant từ Anthropic, được biết đến với khả năng reasoning xuất sắc, instruction-following, và safety alignment. Claude excels at complex reasoning, writing, analysis, và coding tasks. Trong Cursor Enterprise Framework, Claude integration cung cấp alternative với unique strengths nhất định, đặc biệt cho tasks yêu cầu careful reasoning và nuanced understanding.

Mục tiêu của rule này là hướng dẫn developers trong việc integrate Claude APIs một cách hiệu quả, tận dụng features như extended context windows, tool use, và Vision capabilities cho various enterprise applications.

## Nguyên tắc

**1. Anthropic API Setup**

Use official Anthropic SDK. Secure API keys properly. Configure timeouts. Set up retry logic. Monitor usage.

**2. Model Selection**

Choose appropriate Claude model. Opus for complex tasks. Sonnet for balanced use. Haiku for fast tasks. Match to use case.

**3. Prompt Design**

Write clear, specific prompts. Use system prompts effectively. Structure prompts for tasks. Include examples when helpful. Iterate based on results.

**4. Tool Use**

Leverage tool use capabilities. Define tools clearly. Handle tool results. Chain tool calls. Use for complex workflows.

**5. Extended Context**

Use 200K context window effectively. Organize long context. Summarize when needed. Optimize token usage. Avoid context overflow.

**6. Vision Capabilities**

Process images with Claude. Use appropriate image formats. Balance quality vs size. Handle vision errors. Test image inputs.

**7. Safety và Alignment**

Respect Claude's guidelines. Don't attempt to bypass. Handle refusals gracefully. Use for appropriate tasks. Follow usage policies.

**8. Cost Optimization**

Track token usage. Use smaller models when possible. Optimize prompts. Implement caching. Set budget limits.

**9. Error Handling**

Handle API errors. Handle rate limits. Handle timeout errors. Handle safety refusals. Provide user feedback.

**10. Testing và Iteration**

Test with various inputs. Verify responses. Iterate prompts. Gather feedback. Measure performance.

